+## Full-quality OpenGL captures (2026-10-19)
+
+Two Release `19edc4a` NAP-only captures explicitly enabled the current render
+options on Intel HD 4600 at 1280×720. An exploratory run disabled normal/PBR
+maps and IBL. In the last 150 of 300 frames, the full-on runs measured 40.04
+and 52.80 FPS median; maps-off measured 47.56 FPS. The moving M01A/FP7 scene
+and simulation load varied between runs and the result ordering reverses, so
+this cannot isolate the cost of maps. Full-on runs reached 355–467 dropped
+simulation ticks. Asynchronous GPU timer outliers are not frame-aligned totals.
+These verify combined-option startup/rendering on this iGPU, not a stable
+performance baseline. Full CSVs and NAP provenance: [Full-quality profiles]
+(full-quality-capture-20261019/README.md).
